SUMMARY:Native Plant Series: Right Plant in the Right Place
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging workshop where you’ll learn about biodiversity\, native plants and how to enhance your garden!\nWhile other sessions in the Native Plant Series explore how to grow native plants from seed\, this session focuses on choosing the right plants for your garden and finding the best place to plant them. The right plant in the right place is key to growing a successful garden. Whether your space is sunny or shady\, dry or exposed to road salt\, there are native plants suited to every condition.\n \nWe’ll also share local sources for native plants\, shrubs and trees. Fall is the perfect time to plan additions to your garden for next year\, so come learn how to make the best choices for your space!\n \nWednesday\, November 18\, 6:30 to 8 p.m.\nRegistration: Public $20\, TBG Members $15 (plus applicable taxes and fees)\n \nAbout Toronto Master Gardeners\nToronto Master Gardeners (TMG) is a volunteer not-for-profit organization that shares current\, science-based horticultural information with the gardening public through various channels\, including in person\, in print\, through the media\, and online. Our committed volunteers support and inspire the community\, and continually update the sound knowledge required to help them. Learn more and ask your questions Toronto Master Gardeners – Helping Gardeners.\n \nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member!\n \nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/native-plant-series-right-plant-in-the-right-place/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Ave E\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Gardening
